{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21646","headline":"沣西别乐天博载樊宗宪李景信两秀才侄谷三月三十日相饯送 · 元稹","name":"沣西别乐天博载樊宗宪李景信两秀才侄谷三月三十日相饯送","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今朝相送自同游，酒语诗情替别愁。\n忽到沣西总回去，一身骑马向通州。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21646.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21646","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}